#: docs/reference/platforms/support.md:22
msgid ""
"模式限制见[详细支持](../../delivery/support.md)，路线、夹具和生产源码关联见 "
"[派生矩阵](../../delivery/capabilities.md)，目录见[源码图](../../explanation/source-"
"map.md)。"
msgstr ""
"See [detailed support](../../delivery/support.md) for mode limits, the "
"[derived matrix](../../delivery/capabilities.md) for routes, fixtures and "
"production-source associations, and the [source "
"map](../../explanation/source-map.md) for directories."

#: docs/reference/platforms/support.md:25
msgid "当前可选择范围"
msgstr "Current selection scope"

#: docs/reference/platforms/support.md:27
msgid "启明 F407ZG V3.1、独立核心板和 V4.1 保留不同来源与装配身份。"
msgstr ""
"Qiming F407ZG V3.1, standalone core board and V4.1 retain separate sources "
"and assembly identities."

#: docs/reference/platforms/support.md:28
msgid "天空星 F407VE 青春版使用其独立封装和 PCB 事实。"
msgstr "Sky F407VE youth edition uses its own package and PCB facts."

#: docs/reference/platforms/support.md:29
msgid "裸机、FreeRTOS 和明确维护的 ThreadX M4 子集分别选择；启动不进入内核。"
msgstr ""
"Select baremetal, FreeRTOS and the explicitly maintained ThreadX M4 subset "
"independently; Platform startup does not enter a kernel."

#: docs/reference/platforms/support.md:30
msgid ""
"Native 只属于 `tests/support/native/`，需要 `test_support=True`、CLI `--test-"
"support` 或声明了 `NEXUS_TEST_SUPPORT=ON` 的测试 preset。"
msgstr ""
"Native belongs only to `tests/support/native/` and requires "
"`test_support=True`, CLI `--test-support` or a test preset declaring "
"`NEXUS_TEST_SUPPORT=ON`."

#: docs/reference/platforms/support.md:32
msgid "Core／Arch 的 CPU 软件能力与具体 SoC 集成分开，不从 CPU 名称推导芯片支持。"
msgstr ""
"Core/Arch CPU software capabilities remain separate from concrete SoC "
"integration; CPU names do not imply chip support."

#: docs/reference/platforms/support.md:34
msgid ""
"所有 `vendors/` 保留，未使用 SDK 的存在不扩大生产支持。旧 F103、G474、H743、 U575 和 GD32 "
"等接入退出当前生产选择；原证据按 [固定旧源码](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18) 读取，不将旧通过值转移到重构源码。"
msgstr ""
"All `vendors/` sources are retained. Unused SDKs do not expand production "
"support. Earlier F103, G474, H743, U575 and GD32 integrations leave current "
"production selection. Read original evidence against the [fixed prior "
"source](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18); old passes do not "
"transfer to refactored source."

#: docs/reference/platforms/support.md:39
msgid "使用前检查"
msgstr "Checks before use"

#: docs/reference/platforms/support.md:41
msgid "固定完整料号、Board、振荡源和必要跳线条件。"
msgstr ""
"Fix the full part number, Board, oscillator source and required jumper "
"conditions."

#: docs/reference/platforms/support.md:42
msgid "查看对应控制器、route、mode 和资源冲突。"
msgstr "Inspect the controller, route, mode and resource conflicts."

#: docs/reference/platforms/support.md:43
msgid "解析实际 TOML；未知字段、未维护模式与冲突必须拒绝。"
msgstr ""
"Resolve the actual TOML; unknown fields, unmaintained modes and conflicts "
"must reject."

#: docs/reference/platforms/support.md:44
msgid "核对同一源码与配置的模型、ARM、SDK 或候选记录。"
msgstr ""
"Verify model, ARM, SDK or candidate records for the same source and "
"configuration."

#: docs/reference/platforms/support.md:45
msgid "需要物理行为结论时，核对实际 station 原件。"
msgstr "For physical conclusions, verify actual station originals."

#: docs/reference/platforms/support.md:47
msgid ""
"异步 ACCEPTED 后持续借用到 acquire 观察 SETTLED；timeout、cancel 与排空失败 不授权复用存储。物理 HIL 当前为"
" `not_executed`，未知 PCB 修订仍保持未知。 完整资格边界见[资格参考](qualification.md)。"
msgstr ""
"After asynchronous ACCEPTED, borrowing continues until acquire observes "
"SETTLED. Timeout, cancel and failed drain do not authorize storage reuse. "
"Physical HIL is currently `not_executed`, and unknown PCB revisions remain "
"unknown. See the [qualification reference](qualification.md) for complete "
"boundaries."

msgid "当前生产系列入口是 STM32F4，精确器件与模式统一见[详细支持](../../delivery/support.md)。 五个已审料号的事实、四个实体 F407 Board 包及新增料号的内部 CRC 软件参考分别维护。 同系列名称、官方 SDK 文件或器件宏存在，不代表全部 F4、外设组合或实体 PCB 已验证。"
msgstr "STM32F4 is the production family entry; [detailed support](../../delivery/support.md) is the authority for exact devices and modes. Facts for five reviewed parts, four physical F407 Board packages and internal-CRC software references for added parts are maintained separately. A family name, official SDK file or device macro does not validate all F4 parts, peripheral combinations or physical PCBs."
